Output catppuccin-demo.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 16
Set FontFamily "JetBrainsMono Nerd Font Mono"
Set Width 1200
Set Height 700
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 80ms
Set Margin 0
Set BorderRadius 8

Type "ls -la"
Sleep 1500ms
Enter
Sleep 1.5s

Type "lsof"
Sleep 1500ms
Enter
Sleep 1.5s

Type "echo 'hello from this catppuccin mocha'"
Sleep 1500ms
Enter
Sleep 6s
